3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#737970]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"company industry and city\">\n                            Developer tools · Lagos\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 flex items-baseline gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"rating row\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[19px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"rating number\">\n                                4.4\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#a87932]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"star icon\">\n                                ★\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#737970]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-4-3\" data-name=\"review count\">\n                                3 sample reviews\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#626b63]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-5\" data-name=\"company summary text\">\n                            Thoughtful reviews; clear ownership.\n                        </p>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex min-h-[188px] flex-col border border-[#d8dcd5] bg-[#fffefa] p-5 text-inherit no-underline hover:border-[#95aa98] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#286144]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4\" data-name=\"Market Fern company card\" href=\"/companies/market-fern\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#286144]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"company card tag\">\n                            FICTIONAL SAMPLE\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-.3px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"company card title\">\n                            Market Fern\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#737970]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"company industry and city\">\n                            Commerce · Ibadan\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-4\" data-name=\"no reviews indicator\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-[#525a53]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"no published reviews text\">\n                                No published reviews\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-[1.5] text-[#626b63]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-5\" data-name=\"company summary text\">\n                            Be the first to share a sample experience.\n                        </p>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"reviews-title\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-8 py-[72px] max-md:px-5 max-md:py-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" data-name=\"reviews showcase section\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-8 max-md:flex-col max-md:items-start max-md:gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"section heading and link row\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"heading block\">\n                    <h2 class=\"max-w-[710px] text-[34px] font-medium leading-[1.2] tracking-[-1.3px] max-md:text-[29px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"section heading\" id=\"reviews-title\">\n                        More than a rating. Real workplace context.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[14px] text-[#687168]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section subtitle\">\n                        Fictional sample reviews, written to show the kind of detail that helps.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <a class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-[#286144] underline decoration-[#9bb6a0] underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#1f4e35]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"Browse all companies link\" href=\"/companies\">\n                    Browse all companies ↗\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-md:grid-cols-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"review cards grid\">\n                <article class=\"border border-[#d8dcd5] bg-[#fffefa] p-6 max-md:p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"Baobab Circuit review card\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[#e2e5df] pb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"review card header\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"reviewer identity block\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#286144]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"review sample tag\">\n                                FICTIONAL SAMPLE REVIEW\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[17px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"review company title\">\n                                Baobab Circuit\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#727a73]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"reviewer role and status\">\n                                Product designer · Former employee\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"review rating block\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"rating number\">\n                                4.1\n                                <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#a87932]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"star icon\">\n                                    ★\n                                </span>\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#727a73]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"rating label\">\n                                Overall rating\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-5 max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"review pros and cons\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"pros block\">\n                            <h4 class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#286144]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"pros heading\">\n                                Pros\n                            </h4>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-[#525a53]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"pros quote\">\n                                “I had room to shape features early. Peers made time for thoughtful design feedback.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"cons block\">\n                            <h4 class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#737970]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cons heading\">\n                                Cons\n                            </h4>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-[#525a53]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"cons quote\">\n                                “Scope could change mid-sprint; I learned to clarify trade-offs before committing to a deadline.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#e2e5df] pt-3 text-[12px] text-[#737970]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3\" data-name=\"review footer text\">\n                        Sample date: 14 Aug 2024\n                        <span class=\"px-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"separator dot\">\n                            ·\n                        </span>\n                        Demo data only\n                    </p>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"border border-[#d8dcd5] bg-[#fffefa] p-6 max-md:p-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"Lagoon Ledger review card\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[#e2e5df] pb-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"review card header\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"reviewer identity block\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#286144]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"review sample tag\">\n                                FICTIONAL SAMPLE REVIEW\n                            </p>\n                            <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[17px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"review company title\">\n                                Lagoon Ledger\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#727a73]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"reviewer role and status\">\n                                Customer support lead · Current employee\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"review rating block\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"rating number\">\n                                3.2\n                                <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[#a87932]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"star icon\">\n                                    ★\n                                </span>\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#727a73]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"rating label\">\n                                Overall rating\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-5 max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"review pros and cons\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"pros block\">\n                            <h4 class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#286144]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"pros heading\">\n                                Pros\n                            </h4>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-[#525a53]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"pros quote\">\n                                “My manager listened when we raised customer issues. New starters learned alongside experienced teammates.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"cons block\">\n                            <h4 class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#737970]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cons heading\">\n                                Cons\n                            </h4>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-[#525a53]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"cons quote\">\n                                “Release weeks could run long, and promotion expectations weren’t always written down.”\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#e2e5df] pt-3 text-[12px] text-[#737970]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-3\" data-name=\"review footer text\">\n                        Sample date: 03 May 2024\n                        <span class=\"px-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"separator dot\">\n                            ·\n                        </span>\n                        Demo data only\n                    </p>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"privacy-title\" class=\"border-y border-[#e1e3dc] bg-[#f0f2ec]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" data-name=\"privacy and moderation section\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] gap-14 px-8 py-[68px] max-md:grid-cols-1 max-md:gap-7 max-md:px-5 max-md:py-11\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"privacy section container\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"privacy text column\">\n                    <h2 class=\"max-w-[610px] text-[34px] font-medium leading-[1.2] tracking-[-1.3px] max-md:text-[29px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"privacy heading\" id=\"privacy-title\">\n                        Your experience. Shared on your terms.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[610px] text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-[#566057]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"privacy description\">\n                        You can submit a review without an account. Public reviews do not display the author’s identity. Every submission is manually reviewed before publication. Moderation helps keep this space constructive; it does not mean every statement has been independently verified.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-3\" data-name=\"privacy policy links\">\n                        <a class=\"font-medium text-[#286144] underline decoration-[#9bb6a0] underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#1f4e35] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#286144]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"Community Guidelines link\" href=\"/community-guidelines\">\n                            Community Guidelines ↗\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"font-medium text-[#286144] underline decoration-[#9bb6a0] underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#1f4e35] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#286144]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"Privacy Policy link\" href=\"/privacy\">\n                            Privacy Policy ↗\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border-l border-[#d3d9d1] pl-8 max-md:border-l-0 max-md:border-t max-md:pl-0 max-md:pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2\" data-name=\"privacy key points column\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.7] text-[#39413a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"no account required point\">\n                        <strong class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"point heading\">\n                            No account required.\n                        </strong>\n                        Write a review without signing up.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 border-t border-[#d8dcd5] pt-4 text-[14px] leading-[1.7] text-[#39413a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"identity not displayed point\">\n                        <strong class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"point heading\">\n                            Identity not displayed publicly.\n                        </strong>\n                        Public reviews do not show the author’s name.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 border-t border-[#d8dcd5] pt-4 text-[14px] leading-[1.7] text-[#39413a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3\" data-name=\"human moderation point\">\n                        <strong class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"point heading\">\n                            A person reviews submissions.\n                        </strong>\n                        Reviews are moderated before publication.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"final-cta-title\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-8 py-[55px] max-md:px-5 max-md:py-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-7\" data-name=\"final call-to-action section\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-12 border-b border-[#d8dcd5] pb-[55px] max-md:flex-col max-md:items-start max-md:gap-5 max-md:pb-10\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"call-to-action layout\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-[730px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1\" data-name=\"call-to-action text block\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[37px] font-medium leading-[1.18] tracking-[-1.5px] max-md:text-[31px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"call-to-action heading\" id=\"final-cta-title\">\n                        Help someone make a better career decision.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[670px] text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-[#626b63]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"call-to-action description\">\n                        Your workplace experience could give someone the context they need before accepting their next offer.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex shrink-0 flex-col items-start gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2\" data-name=\"call-to-action buttons column\">\n                    <a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-[7px] bg-[#286144] px-5 text-[14px] font-medium text-white no-underline hover:bg-[#1f4e35] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#286144]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Write an Anonymous Review button\" href=\"/write-review\">\n                        Write an Anonymous Review\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ml-2 text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"external arrow glyph\">\n                            ↗\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-[#286144] underline decoration-[#9bb6a0] underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#1f4e35]\" data-kid=\"1-2-7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Find a Company link\" href=\"/companies\">\n                        Find a Company\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#202923] text-[#eef1eb]\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"site footer\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-8 pb-7 pt-10 max-md:px-5 max-md:pt-8\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr] gap-10 max-md:grid-cols-1 max-md:gap-8\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"footer columns\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand column\">\n                    <a class=\"flex w-fit items-center gap-2.5 text-[19px] font-semibold tracking-[-.6px] text-[#fffefa] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer logo link\" href=\"/\">\n                        <span class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[8px] bg-[#9fbea3] text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#202923]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"logo mark badge\">\n                            w.\n                        </span>\n                        Worktruth\n                    </a>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[300px] text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-[#b9c1b9]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer brand tagline\">\n                        More context for your next career move.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer explore column\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-[#bec8bf]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer explore heading\">\n                        Explore\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4 flex